{
  "interpretation": "No generator is available here, so I will shape the existing intro stems into that sound: reverb- and delay-drenched theatrical vocals, a warm reedy low-mid baritone-reed colour on the keys, bright driven chorused guitar-like synths, and an opening-up swell of texture and drums — all confined to the eight-bar intro with lane automation.",
  "notices": [
    "No generation capability is offered: the baritone-sax and glam-guitar character is produced by tone-shaping the existing Keys, Synths and Texture stems rather than adding new recorded parts.",
    "All effects are added with neutral baseline settings and only rise where the intro's lane automation moves, so the rest of the song is untouched. The locked Bridge section is not modified."
  ],
  "variants": [
    {
